### Global Variables
@host = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json
@admin_token = <REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_TOKEN>
@user_token = <REPLACE_WITH_USER_TOKEN>

### ==========================================
### Phase 1: User & Authentication
### ==========================================

### 1.1 Login (Admin)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "password"
}

### 1.1 Login (Student)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "student1",
  "password": "password"
}

### 1.5 Get User Info
GET {{host}}/api/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### ==========================================
### Phase 2: Event Core
### ==========================================

### 2.1 List Events
GET {{host}}/api/event/page?currentPage=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 2.2 Create Event (Admin)
POST {{host}}/api/event/EventList
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Spring Sports 2026",
  "description": "Annual Spring Sports Event",
  "registrationStartTime": "2026-03-01 00:00:00",
  "registrationEndTime": "2026-03-20 00:00:00",
  "eventStartTime": "2026-04-01 09:00:00",
  "eventEndTime": "2026-04-03 17:00:00",
  "status": "DRAFT",
  "maxItemsPerAthlete": 3
}

### 2.3 Update Event Status (Publish)
PUT {{host}}/api/event/1/status?status=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 2.4 Create Project
POST {{host}}/api/project
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "eventId": 1,
  "itemName": "100m Dash",
  "grade": "All",
  "limitation": "MALE",
  "maxAttendance": 50,
  "category": "TRACK",
  "startTime": "2026-04-01 10:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-04-01 11:00:00"
}

### 2.5 List Projects
GET {{host}}/api/project/event/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 2.8 Register Project (Student)
POST {{host}}/api/registration
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "eventId": 1,
  "itemId": 1
}

### ==========================================
### Phase 3: Score & Notification
### ==========================================

### 3.1 Import Scores (Multipart - Requires Tool Support, Mocking Header here)
# Note: This request is illustrative. In IntelliJ HTTP Client, you can use 'multipart/form-data'.
POST {{host}}/api/score/import/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="scores.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./scores.xlsx
--WebAppBoundary--

### 3.2 List Scores (Admin - All)
GET {{host}}/api/score/page?eventName=Spring
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 3.3 Publish Scores
PUT {{host}}/api/score/publish/1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 3.4 List Scores (Public - Published Only)
GET {{host}}/api/score/page?eventName=Spring
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### 3.6 Get Notifications
GET {{host}}/api/notification/page?currentPage=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### 3.7 Get Unread Count
GET {{host}}/api/notification/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### 3.8 Mark Read
PUT {{host}}/api/notification/read/1
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### 3.9 Mark All Read
PUT {{host}}/api/notification/read-all
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

